// (c) Copyright, Joe Leslie-Hurd, 2004
// (c) Copyright, Michael Faerber and Cezary Kaliszyk, 2014-2018.
//
// Distributed under the same license as HOL Light.
// =========================================================================

// Quotations are HOL Light text, `@hol|{...}|`; every proof is replayed here.

